---
title: Host deposit top-up and commission (model M1)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Host owner
    actor F1 as Finance staff
    actor F2 as Second finance staff
    participant A as Django API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    H->>H: Transfers 50,000 DZD to the BLADUS CCP account
    H->>A: (optional) uploads the transfer receipt
    F1->>A: POST /admin/wallet-topups (host, amount, method, receipt ref)
    A->>DB: unique check on method + receipt ref
    alt amount up to 500,000 DZD
        A->>DB: approved, ledger cash debit / host wallet credit
    else above the threshold
        A->>DB: pending_approval
        F2->>A: POST /admin/wallet-topups/{id}/approve
        A->>DB: approved, ledger postings
    end
    A-)H: deposit received notification
    Note over A,DB: each later confirmed booking posts its commission against this wallet
